    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Occluder</i> is an investigation game filled with suspense! With various gameplay difficulties, you can adapt to your style and face each challenge. The game also features online interactions, including a chat function to communicate with other players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bruce is an investigator hired by Maria to find her husband, Alex, a journalist who disappeared while documenting strange creatures in a hazardous area. This zone was affected by a nuclear disaster in Russia, altering the residents. After a failed government mission to contain the situation, your task is to film the area and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Armed only with your camera and flashlight, explore the environment, capture footage, and try to survive this terrifying place.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Occluder</i> is an investigation game filled with suspense! With various gameplay difficulties, you can adapt to your style and face each challenge. The game also features online interactions, including a chat function to communicate with other players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bruce is an investigator hired by Maria to find her husband, Alex, a journalist who disappeared while documenting strange creatures in a hazardous area. This zone was affected by a nuclear disaster in Russia, altering the residents. After a failed government mission to contain the situation, your task is to film the area and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Armed only with your camera and flashlight, explore the environment, capture footage, and try to survive this terrifying place.</p>",
    "short_description": "Investigate and film a sinister area in The Occluder! Uncover the truth behind the mysterious disappearances while navigating a dangerous zone altered by a nuclear disaster. Use your camera and flashlight to document the chilling surroundings and escape the horrors that lurk within.",
